<title>UK: Anglian Water shares up, cheered by results.</title>
<headline>Anglian Water shares up, cheered by results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Anglian Water Plc rose 6-1/2 pence to 689 pence after the company reported full-year profits at the higher end of market expectations, dealers said.</p>
<p>The market shrugged its shoulders at news Anglian would takeover Hartlepool Water Plc in an agreed 19.5 million stg bid.</p>
<p>Anglian is offering 266 pence per Hartlepool share.  </p>
<p>&quot;The shares are up on the results. The takeover is not that exciting,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>Shares in Hartlepool Water, meanwhile,rose 62-1/2 pence to 257-1/2.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
